  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 4399,
      "text": "Indeed, the wicked will be in the punishment of Hell forever.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 74,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 495,
      "ruku": 430,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4400,
      "text": "It will not be lightened for them, and they will remain therein in utter despair.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 75,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 495,
      "ruku": 430,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4401,
      "text": "We did not wrong them, but they themselves were the wrongdoers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 76,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 495,
      "ruku": 430,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4402,
      "text": "They will cry out, “O Mālik[28], let your Lord put an end to us!” He will say, “You are here to stay.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 77,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 495,
      "ruku": 430,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4403,
      "text": "We surely brought you the truth, but most of you were averse to the truth.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 78,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 495,
      "ruku": 430,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4404,
      "text": "Have they devised a plan[29]? We too have devised a plan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 79,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 495,
      "ruku": 430,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4405,
      "text": "Do they think that We do not hear their secret talks and private counsels? Yes indeed, and Our angel-messengers are with them recording everything.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 80,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 495,
      "ruku": 430,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4406,
      "text": "Say, “If the Most Compassionate truly had a son, I would be the first of [his] worshipers[30].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 81,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 495,
      "ruku": 430,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4407,
      "text": "Glory be to the Lord of the heavens and earth, Lord of the Throne, far above what they ascribe [to Him].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 82,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 495,
      "ruku": 430,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4408,
      "text": "So leave them to indulge in falsehood and amuse themselves until they meet their Day that they are promised.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 83,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 495,
      "ruku": 430,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4409,
      "text": "It is He Who is God in the heaven and God on earth, and He is the All-Wise, the All-Knowing.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 84,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 495,
      "ruku": 430,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4410,
      "text": "Blessed is He to Whom belongs the dominion of the heavens and earth and all that is between them. With Him is the knowledge of the Hour, and to Him you will be returned.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 85,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 495,
      "ruku": 430,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4411,
      "text": "Those whom they supplicate[31] besides Him have no power to intercede, except those who testify to the truth knowingly[32].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 86,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 495,
      "ruku": 430,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4412,
      "text": "If you ask them who created them[33], they will surely say, “Allah.” How are they then deluded?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 87,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 495,
      "ruku": 430,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4413,
      "text": "And [Allah acknowledges] his saying[34], “O my Lord, these are a people who do not believe.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 88,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 495,
      "ruku": 430,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4414,
      "text": "So turn away from them and say, “Peace[35].” They will come to know.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
